Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Overcharged cavities: elastic theory of the wall layer (shielding)\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"4645542e-cd88-41ca-b15f-32c75c8f0ffc"],

Cell["\<\
Benjamin Loewe (with Claude), 2026-10-06. Companion to Sec. \"Elastic theory \
of the wall layer\" of reports/master/master.pdf. Built by build_notebook.wl \
from the scripts shielding_disk.wl and shielding_ellipse.wl.\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"c3b84f5e-b508-4940-93a7-bd0f55387c6e"],

Cell["\<\
How to use: evaluate top to bottom (Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook). Energies \
are in units of \[Pi]K, lengths in MPCD cells. The ellipse relaxation (Sec. \
5) takes ~10 min, so by default it loads the saved relaxed positions; set \
recompute = True to redo it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8c7ad02d-4237-4c6f-beb1-bedd8ac821ee"],

Cell["\<\
SetDirectory[\"/home/baloewe/Physics/Overcharged/reports/master/theory/\"];
projectRoot = \
\"/home/baloewe/Physics/Overcharged/reports/master/theory/../../..\";\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->" In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8b49670b-bec6-441b-a071-07ce7496dce8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Model", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7dbd5651-45c7-40d6-90b1-4bc4e631fb6a"],

Cell["\<\
One-constant Frank elasticity, director angle \[Theta], defects of charge q_i \
at z_i (complex positions). Use the field \[Psi] conjugate to \[Theta] \
(\[Del]\[Psi] = z\[Cross]\[Del]\[Theta]): defects are point sources, \[Del]\
\[Psi]^2 = 2\[Pi] \[Sum] q_i \[Delta](z - z_i). Strong anchoring fixes \
\[Theta] along the wall, so \[PartialD]_s\[Theta] is prescribed: a Neumann \
condition for \[Psi], with flux density equal to the imposed winding per \
length. In a disk of radius R the Neumann Green's function has images of the \
SAME sign at R^2/z\[Conjugate], so the wall repels every defect. Energy (core \
terms dropped):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c6bda5a-df2d-46a9-a172-9dd09cdc5666"],

Cell["\<\
E/(\[Pi]K) = - \[Sum]_{i\[NotEqual]j} q_i q_j Log|z_i - z_j| - \[Sum]_{i,j} \
q_i q_j Log|R^2 - z_i Conjugate[z_j]|\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c1987461-d289-4ff1-887b-fb50534be684"],

Cell["\<\
Pieces: -2\[Pi]K q_i q_j Log r_ij is -(\[Pi]/2)K Log r for like \
\[PlusMinus]1/2 (repulsion); the self-image term -\[Pi]K q_i^2 Log(R^2 - \
r_i^2) = -(\[Pi]/4)K Log(R^2 - r^2) is the repulsion from the wall. These are \
the poster's U_ij and U_W,i with the poster's sign convention U = -E; the \
formula above adds the cross-image terms.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"901ccefe-e29e-4eb7-bb2e-3c0a91d12af5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Edisk[zs_List, qs_List, R_] := Module[{n = Length[zs]},
  -Sum[qs[[i]] qs[[j]] Log[Abs[zs[[i]] - zs[[j]]]], {i, n}, {j, \
Complement[Range[n], {i}]}]
  - Sum[qs[[i]] qs[[j]] Log[Abs[R^2 - zs[[i]] Conjugate[zs[[j]]]]], {i, n}, \
{j, n}]];
(* single defect: energy against distance from the centre -> repulsion from \
the wall *)
Plot[Edisk[{r}, {1/2}, 1] - Edisk[{0.}, {1/2}, 1], {r, 0, 0.98}, Frame -> True,
 FrameLabel -> {\"r/R\", \"E (\[Pi]K)\"}, PlotLabel -> \"one +1/2 in a disk: \
the wall repels\"]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->" In[3]:=",ExpressionUUID->"10fdf6ca-7182-459e-a22c-e86fee15a0a1"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
-Graphics-\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.00029748215574*^9},
 CellLabel->" Out[5]=",ExpressionUUID->"7e783519-7396-4cbb-b40b-3a43acaa771a"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Exact shielding in a circle", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"d2adf810-0244-4191-9d0c-fffc8510bcca"],

Cell["\<\
For N wall charges q_w evenly spaced on a ring of radius r_w: \[Sum]_j Log|z \
- r_w e^(2\[Pi]i j/N)| = Log|z^N - r_w^N|. A bulk charge q_t at z = r e^(i\
\[CurlyPhi]) then feels\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a09c0ab1-ee11-4497-82f4-fffbeb1311c3"],

Cell["\<\
V/(\[Pi]K) = const - 2 q_t q_w [ Log|1 - (r/r_w)^N e^(iN\[CurlyPhi])| + Log|1 \
- (r r_w/R^2)^N e^(iN\[CurlyPhi])| ] - q_t^2 Log(R^2 - r^2)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3a7b616d-ace3-43bb-b913-8a38d9cc7b66"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
(* the identity, numerically *)
With[{z = 0.31 + 0.47 I, r = 0.9, n = 7}, Sum[Log[Abs[z - r Exp[2 Pi I \
j/n]]], {j, 0, n - 1}] - Log[Abs[z^n - r^n]]]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->" In[6]:=",ExpressionUUID->"502560be-d1ad-4795-a2e9-f2178ce0fc8a"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
           -16
-2.22045 10\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.000297482169594*^9},
 CellLabel->" Out[7]=",ExpressionUUID->"9b23da9d-880d-4f20-b9b0-d72b118a66f4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Both brackets vanish on angular average (2D shell theorem, images included): \
inside the ring the bulk does not feel the wall layer, whatever its charge. \
Only a corrugation of relative size (r/r_w)^N remains near the wall.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"78f481de-21aa-425a-af55-b0e67dd1a032"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Table[NIntegrate[Log[Abs[1 - a Exp[I t]]], {t, 0, 2 Pi}]/(2 Pi), {a, {0.3, \
0.7, 0.95}}] // Chop\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->" In[8]:=",ExpressionUUID->"91856f0b-61f4-4eca-9dbc-a90525abe3bb"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
{0, 0, 0}\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0002974822740107`*^9},
 CellLabel->" Out[8]=",ExpressionUUID->"2111b8f3-ed1d-4c40-8d65-d9c4e06ea7f6"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Vring[r_, phi_, nn_, rw_, R_, qt_, qw_] := -2 qt qw (nn Log[rw] + Log[Abs[1 - \
(r/rw)^nn Exp[I nn phi]]] +
    2 nn Log[R] + Log[Abs[1 - (r rw/R^2)^nn Exp[I nn phi]]]);
Vself[r_, R_, qt_] := -qt^2 Log[R^2 - r^2];
Manipulate[
 DensityPlot[If[x^2 + y^2 < 1, Vring[Sqrt[x^2 + y^2], Arg[x + I y], nn, rw, \
1, 1/2, qw], None], {x, -1, 1}, {y, -1, 1},
  PlotPoints -> 90, ColorFunction -> \"TemperatureMap\", PlotRange -> {-1, \
1}, ClippingStyle -> Automatic, PlotLegends -> Automatic,
  PlotLabel -> \"energy of a bulk +1/2 from the wall ring (\[Pi]K)\"],
 {{nn, 14, \"wall defects N\"}, 4, 40, 2}, {{rw, 0.94, \"ring radius \
r_w/R\"}, 0.8, 0.99}, {{qw, -1/2, \"wall charge\"}, {-1/2, 1/2}}]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->" In[9]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b98fb0b5-baba-43c0-8761-893b2aab24a2"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
                           2    2
Manipulate[DensityPlot[If[x  + y  < 1, 
 
                  2    2                            1
>     Vring[Sqrt[x  + y ], Arg[x + I y], nn, rw, 1, -, qw], None], 
                                                    2
 
>    {x, -1, 1}, {y, -1, 1}, PlotPoints -> 90, 
 
>    ColorFunction -> TemperatureMap, PlotRange -> {-1, 1}, 
 
>    ClippingStyle -> Automatic, PlotLegends -> Automatic, 
 
>    PlotLabel -> energy of a bulk +1/2 from the wall ring (\
\[CapitalIDoubleDot]\.80K)], 
 
>   {{nn, 14, wall defects N}, 4, 40, 2}, 
 
>   {{rw, 0.94, ring radius r_w/R}, 0.8, 0.99}, 
 
            1                    1   1
>   {{qw, -(-), wall charge}, {-(-), -}}]
            2                    2   2\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0002974822792377`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  " Out[11]=",ExpressionUUID->"88ce6d06-edf3-4028-9b96-303dd628fe59"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3. Where the passive wall layer sits", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"beb962fe-fce6-44da-bcf7-fbfc6d3b2d92"],

Cell["\<\
Energy of a passive ring of N charges q at radius r: E/(\[Pi]K) = -q^2 N \
[(N-1) Log r + Log(R^(2N) - r^(2N))] + const. Claimed minimum r* = R \
((N-1)/(3N-1))^(1/(2N)); for large N the depth is (Log 3/(4\[Pi])) \[Times] \
spacing \[TildeTilde] 0.087 \[Times] spacing.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"88da2349-9251-437c-ba90-746f84672f94"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Ering[r_, nn_, R_, q_] := -q^2 nn ((nn - 1) Log[r] + Log[R^(2 nn) - r^(2 nn)]);
rstar = R ((n - 1)/(3 n - 1))^(1/(2 n));
FullSimplify[D[Ering[r, n, R, q], r] /. r -> rstar, n > 1 && R > 0 && q > 0]  \
 (* = 0: stationary *)\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  " In[12]:=",ExpressionUUID->"02476e6c-36c5-4b4e-b8d8-1ca143da1513"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
0\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.000297482352611*^9},
 CellLabel->
  " Out[14]=",ExpressionUUID->"606f4a89-a1e8-4ed2-ae37-b6f9a900c13f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
D[Ering[r, 12, 1, 1/2], {r, 2}] /. r -> N[(11/35)^(1/24)]   (* > 0: minimum *)\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  " In[15]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0c03dd69-7025-4bf6-bba5-e4d5156b30ca"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
1271.95\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.000297482354827*^9},
 CellLabel->
  " Out[15]=",ExpressionUUID->"81e698ba-3325-434f-933c-f9f16453cfb6"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
(* with a bulk charge Qb at the centre (active layer) *)
Eact[r_, nn_, R_, q_, Qb_] := Ering[r, nn, R, q] - 2 q Qb nn Log[r];
FullSimplify[D[Eact[r, n, R, q, Qb], r] /. r -> R ((n - 1 + 2 Qb/q)/(3 n - 1 \
+ 2 Qb/q))^(1/(2 n)), n > 1 && R > 0 && q > 0 && Qb >= 0]\
\>", "Input",
 CellLabel->
  " In[16]:=",ExpressionUUID->"4b73fd96-c51e-4b21-b55c-3497f6006f7d"],

Cell[OutputFormData["\<\
0\
\>"], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.000297482408751*^9},
 CellLabel->
  " Out[18]=",ExpressionUUID->"1c6d4834-3a25-419d-b245-7d6090cb697e"]
}, Open  ]],

